//     an expansion ($X, ${X}, $(…), `…`, %X%), whose value the guard can't know;
//   - it changes folder (cd, pushd, popd, chdir, Set-Location…, also cd.. / cd\) and runs anything else;
//   - a per-command folder option (env -C / --chdir, git -C, make -C / --directory, tar -C /
