// research/design/review/skeptic/auditor passes — and a single ticket ran 1,008 agent turns and
// 45-78M tokens). Every agent call starts a fresh context and pays for it again. A cap would
// block real work, so a heavy-looking script is ADVICE, not a block: the launch goes ahead and
// the AI gets a note (PreToolUse additionalContext) naming what looks heavy and the lean shape.
// The one hard rule is free to meet: each agent's prompt says why that role exists
// ("Role why: <one line>"), so every role is a decision.
export const AGENT_SITE_CAP = 10;
