        'First launch a reviewer subagent (Agent) on the exact change this run would test, including the test rules it checks.',
        `When it passes, the reviewer runs: node "${SELF}" --approve "<one line: what it checked>"`,
        'Then start the run again. Any later change to the code needs a new review.',
    ].join('\n');
